@* The mark for a field that must be filled in: a red asterisk, read out as "required". Put it in the field's label, set
   aria-required on the field, and say what it means once on the form with <RequiredNote />. Fields that are not
   compulsory carry no mark. *@
<span class="req" title="Required"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (required)</span></span>
